{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:20 2026-09-02 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:20 2026-09-02 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:20 2026-09-02 HKT</p><p>今日（2日）下午1時26分，牛池灣扎山道381至383號號發生交通意外。一部載有學童的校巴與另一校巴前後相撞。其中一校巴車上9名學童、司機腳傷流血、一名保母，以及車外3名職員共14人均輕傷。救護員到場處理傷者，將他們逐一送院檢查。</p><p>現場是德望小學暨幼稚園，所見涉事的兩部校巴分別車頭及車尾損毀。大批警員及救護員在場協助傷者。據悉，涉事的學童並無表面傷，警方正調查意外原因。</p><img alt=\"兩校巴前後相撞。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e659788b3a7d4d3c09a78fc807cbf06a/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_14_13_18.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/518e1cf985b9807b733def051eb5de56/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_14_13_20_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0409e2bab979e7475f2f796127aaa63c/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_14_13_19_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d6f6cccf452d16874e816aa35ed12c77/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_14_13_19.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7e9b0da15928d70d414d7bd2f2762727/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_14_13_18_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"多名救護員到場協助傷者。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0730b6fd19a3ce2b92f98667683e606d/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_14_13_18_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fecb5016e39eb1e115bedac22424e964/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_14_13_17_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場是德望小學暨幼稚園。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bd946db228bc42afcbd2f42edf3f8f62/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-02_at_14_13_16.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T07:04:51.610695+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":269,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}